  m_text: 'Focus: Controlled Instability and explosive damage.



    Gains Instability
    through damage taken and Destabilization.



    Defense becomes stronger as
    Instability increases.



    Focused Instability: Gain a large amount of Controlled
    Instability.



    Re-Stabilization: Consume Instability to recover HP.



    Loss
    of Control: Consume all Instability to deal massive damage to all enemies, at
    the cost of HP.'
