  m_text: 'Health: 85 | Defense: 17% | Crit: +5%



    Role: Ranged damage dealer
    focused on Critical Hits, Accuracy, and offensive Tokens.



    Leader Passive:
    Critical Strike damage increases with each Critical Strike dealt.

    Companion
    Passive: Basic Attacks can generate Lucky Shot.



    Corruption: Reduces Accuracy
    while increasing Critical Chance.'
