  m_text: 'Focus: Accuracy, debuffs, and single-target burst damage.



    Improves
    Rifle/Pistol Accuracy and damage.



    Heat Vision: Applies Vulnerability and
    Exposition.



    Corrosive Bite: Applies Corrosion.



    Strangle: Damage
    and Critical Chance scale with the target''s debuffs.'
