  m_text: 'Health: 100 | Defense: 25% | Crit: +3%



    Role: Defensive frontline
    character focused on Defense, Controlled Instability, and Destabilization.



    Leader
    Passive: Heal 5 HP per defeated enemy.

    Companion Passive: +2% Defense per
    18 missing HP.



    Corruption: Taking damage temporarily increases Defense,
    but reduces base Defense according to Corruption Tier.'
